| `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR` | path | unset: `[using default] CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR = <hidden>` | a directory | the `claude-code-headless` adapter's child, through `config/project.json` `models.credential_env`; `tests/integration/test_committed_secrets_gate.py` takes the name from `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR` row | Points the model CLI at another configuration directory. Its row is secret because `models.credential_env` lists it, so a value under this name in a file a commit could carry fails the committed-secrets gate. | any other child | always |
